---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="RFC-001: The Pedagogical Decision Record (PDR)">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-[#EFEFEF]">
    <header class="mb-12 border-b-2 border-[#E95420] pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">RFC-001: The Pedagogical Decision Record (PDR)</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#E95420] font-mono">Status: Draft | Context: AI-Assisted EdTech</p>
    </header>

    <article class="prose prose-invert prose-orange max-w-none">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">1. Abstract</h2>
      <p>
        The "black-box" approach to AI in education is failing. We are replacing the "Hard Work" of learning with the "Efficiency" of generation. The PDR ensures that <strong>Domain Governance</strong> acts as the primary constraint on any AI generation process.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">2. The Protocol</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li><strong>No-Fly Zone:</strong> If a query falls outside the defined pedagogical scope, the system must refuse generation.</li>
        <li><strong>Contextual Binding:</strong> The PDR is injected into the system prompt as a "System Contract."</li>
        <li><strong>Audit Trail:</strong> Every interaction persists a snapshot for pedagogical auditing.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">3. The Schema (JSON)</h2>
      <pre class="bg-[#200718] p-4 rounded-md border border-gray-700 text-sm font-mono text-[#E95420]">
{
  "pdr_id": "uuid",
  "pedagogical_domain": {
    "scope": ["nominativ_case"],
    "out_of_scope": ["plural_forms"],
    "governance": { "anti_overcorrection": true }
  }
}
      </pre>

      <footer class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-gray-700">
        <p class="italic text-gray-400">"Pedagogy governs technology—not the other way around."</p>
        <a href="/" class="text-[#E95420] hover:underline mt-4 block">← Return to Home</a>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Fuerza el fondo global de la marca */
  :global(body) {
    background-color: #300A24;
  }
</style>
